Description: A suite of functions for analyzing and visualizing the health economic outputs of mathematical models.
    Development was funded by the National Institutes of Health through awards R01AI138783, K01DA048985,
    U01CA319117, U01CA319219 and U01CA319218. The content of this package is solely the responsibility
    of the authors and does not necessarily represent the official views of the National Institutes of
    Health. The theoretical underpinnings of 'dampack''s functionality are detailed in Hunink et al.
    (2014) <doi:10.1017/CBO9781139506779>.
